        <div class="mrow"><span class="txt"><span class="nm">Áfonyás camemberttel töltött csirkemell</span><span class="ds">Kirántva, áfonyás camembert töltelékkel.</span></span><span class="mid"></span><span class="pr">3 750 Ft</span></div>
